Growatt NOAH BLE Watchdog
------------------------
Copyright 2026 nixo2

This standalone watchdog application builds on the Growatt NOAH Bluetooth
protocol implementation and BLE communication code by Peter Meiser.

Original project: https://github.com/meiser79/growatt_noah_ble

The watchdog-specific functionality includes interactive device selection,
periodic BLE scanning, sequential status monitoring, and connection-state
logging. The current version performs monitoring only; automatic recovery
by rewriting WiFi or MQTT settings is a planned feature, not implemented.

This watchdog is independently maintained and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Growatt New Energy Co., Ltd.
